    },
    "该地址在局域网或本机；请开启“局域网自建服务器”。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This address is on the LAN or this device; turn on “LAN self-hosted server”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该地址在局域网或本机；请开启“局域网自建服务器”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該位址在區域網路或本機；請開啟「區域網路自架伺服器」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通知中的链接不含任何令牌；打开后仅用本机配对重新查询。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The notification link contains no token; opening it only re-queries using this phone's pairing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知中的链接不含任何令牌；打开后仅用本机配对重新查询。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知中的連結不含任何權杖；開啟後僅用本機配對重新查詢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过已配对的网关检查是否有正在响铃的来电，并显示系统来电界面；不会自动接听。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check with the paired gateway whether an incoming call is ringing and show the system call UI; never answers automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过已配对的网关检查是否有正在响铃的来电，并显示系统来电界面；不会自动接听。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過已配對的閘道檢查是否有正在響鈴的來電，並顯示系統來電介面；不會自動接聽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认关闭。关闭时来电完全走原生推送与系统来电界面，不会连接任何 Bark 服务器；打开 App 的配对、推送与通话路径都不依赖 Bark。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. While off, calls use only native push and the system call UI and no Bark server is contacted; pairing, push and calling never depend on Bark."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。关闭时来电完全走原生推送与系统来电界面，不会连接任何 Bark 服务器；打开 App 的配对、推送与通话路径都不依赖 Bark。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設關閉。關閉時來電完全走原生推播與系統來電介面，不會連線任何 Bark 伺服器；App 的配對、推播與通話路徑都不依賴 Bark。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 未在运行，无法显示可接听的系统来电；请打开 App 后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is not running, so an answerable system call cannot be shown; open the app and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 未在运行，无法显示可接听的系统来电；请打开 App 后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 未在執行，無法顯示可接聽的系統來電；請開啟 App 後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
